          objective: 'The objective is to make the lowest possible five-card hand using ace-to-five (A-5) lowball ranking: aces count as low, straights and flushes do not count, and the best hand is 5-4-3-2-A (the wheel).',
          gameplay: '1. Ante. 2. Third street: 2 down, 1 up. Lowest up brings. 3. Fourthâ€“Seventh: 1 up each (last down). 4. Betting after each. 5. Best low wins. No straights/flushes. A=1.',
